---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/instruction-vs-artifact-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/instruction-vs-artifact-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={520}
  caption="Same goal, two paths. The rules you state rarely transfer; the corpus you show does."
>
  Two paths. Telling the model the rules — instruction — leads to the model
  being told, which rarely transfers. Giving the model a folder of your
  writing — artifact — leads to the model reading examples, which transfers
  reliably.
</Diagram>
